"sql-select": {"question":"Which columns and rows will this query return?","translation":"Какие столбцы и строки вернёт этот запрос?","context":"The products table contains product names, prices in ILS and stock quantities. Describe the result; row order is not part of this question.","choices":["All columns for all products.","Only the name column for all products.","Only the names of products that are in stock."],"answer":"The query returns the name column for every row in products. There is no WHERE clause, so it does not filter out any rows. Without ORDER BY, the row order is not guaranteed.","answerRu":"Запрос возвращает столбец name для всех строк products. Условия WHERE нет, поэтому строки не отфильтровываются. Без ORDER BY порядок строк не гарантируется.","terms":[["column","столбец"],["row","строка таблицы"],["result set","результат запроса"],["WHERE clause","условие отбора строк"]],"checkpoint":"What will SELECT price FROM products return?","checkpointChoices":["Only the prices of all products.","The names and prices of all products."]},
"sql-greater": {"question":"Which condition selects products priced strictly above 2,000 ILS?","translation":"Какое условие выберет товары строго дороже 2000 ₪?","context":"Select by price. Exclude products priced at exactly 2,000 ILS. All prices are integers; there are no NULL values in this task.","choices":["price < 2000","price > 2000","price >= 2000"],"answer":"I would use price > 2000. The greater-than operator excludes the boundary value of 2000. Using >= would also include that value, which does not meet the requirement.","answerRu":"Я использую price > 2000. Знак «больше» исключает граничное значение 2000. Условие >= включило бы его, а это не соответствует требованию.","terms":[["greater than","больше"],["strictly above","строго больше, без равенства"],["boundary value","граничное значение"],["requirement","требование"]],"checkpoint":"A product costs exactly 2,000 ILS. Does it match price >= 2000?","checkpointChoices":["No. It selects only more expensive products.","Yes. The condition also includes exactly 2000."]},
"sql-boundary": {"question":"Will this query return the product priced at 2,500 ILS?","translation":"Вернёт ли этот запрос товар за 2500 ₪?","context":"The table contains only the row shown below. Price is numeric and there are no other filter conditions.","choices":["Yes. The condition includes the price 2500.","No. 2500 is not less than 2500.","The query will fail because the price equals the boundary value."],"answer":"No. The condition price < 2500 excludes 2500 itself. The query executes successfully but returns an empty result set because the only row does not meet the condition.","answerRu":"Нет. Условие price < 2500 не включает само значение 2500. Запрос выполнится успешно, но результат будет пустым: единственная строка не подходит под условие.","terms":[["less than","меньше"],["empty result set","результат без строк"],["boundary value","граничное значение"],["query execution","выполнение запроса"]],"checkpoint":"Will a product priced at 2,499 ILS match WHERE price < 2500?","checkpointChoices":["Yes. 2499 is less than 2500.","No. Only products priced at exactly 2500 match."]},
"sql-and": {"question":"Will this product be included in the result set? Explain why.","translation":"Попадёт ли этот товар в результат запроса? Объясни причину.","context":"Select products priced below 2,500 ILS that are in stock. The only product costs 2,200 ILS and has a stock quantity of 0.","choices":["Yes. The price condition is met, which is enough.","No. The product is out of stock.","No. The query requires a price above 2500."],"answer":"No. The price condition is met, but the stock condition is not. AND requires both conditions to be met. Since stock is 0, the product is excluded from the result set.","answerRu":"Нет. Цена подходит, но товар отсутствует на складе. AND требует выполнения обоих условий. Остаток равен нулю, поэтому товар не попадёт в результат.","terms":[["condition","условие"],["in stock","есть в наличии"],["out of stock","нет в наличии"],["both conditions","оба условия"]],"checkpoint":"The same product now has a stock quantity of 3. Will the query return it?","checkpointChoices":["No. Stock does not affect this query.","Yes. Both the price and stock conditions are met."]},
"sql-fields": {"question":"Which query returns exactly two columns: name and price?","translation":"Какой запрос вернёт ровно два столбца: name и price?","context":"Return names and prices for every product. Do not filter by availability. Row order is not specified.","choices":["SELECT name AND price FROM products;","SELECT * FROM products;","SELECT name, price FROM products;"],"answer":"I would use SELECT name, price FROM products. A comma separates the selected columns. The asterisk would also return stock, while AND combines logical conditions rather than listing columns.","answerRu":"Я использую SELECT name, price FROM products. Выбранные столбцы разделяются запятой. Звёздочка также вернула бы stock, а AND соединяет логические условия, а не перечисляет столбцы.","terms":[["selected columns","выбранные столбцы"],["comma","запятая"],["asterisk","звёздочка *"],["logical operator","логический оператор"]],"checkpoint":"Which query returns only the product name and stock quantity?","checkpointChoices":["SELECT name AND stock FROM products;","SELECT * FROM products;","SELECT name, stock FROM products;"]},
"sql-order": {"question":"How would you sort the products from most expensive to cheapest?","translation":"Как отсортировать товары от самого дорогого к самому дешёвому?","context":"Return name and price for all products. Only the order should change. All prices in this example are different.","choices":["ORDER BY price ASC","ORDER BY price DESC","ORDER BY name DESC"],"answer":"I would add ORDER BY price DESC. Price is the sort column, and DESC means descending order, so the highest price comes first. ASC would give the opposite order.","answerRu":"Я добавлю ORDER BY price DESC. Сортируем столбец цены. DESC означает убывание: сначала самая высокая цена. ASC дало бы обратный порядок.","terms":[["sort order","порядок сортировки"],["ascending / ASC","по возрастанию"],["descending / DESC","по убыванию"],["sort column","столбец сортировки"]],"checkpoint":"Prices are 1800, 3000 and 900 ILS. What is the order with ORDER BY price ASC?","checkpointChoices":["900 → 1800 → 3000.","3000 → 1800 → 900."]}
